{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1793","id":4167168214,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p874YfDW","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1793","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1793.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1793.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1793","number":1793,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Produce P5-02 permutations and combinations release","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nProduces the immutable P5-02 Permutations and combinations Family delta and advances the authenticated Paper 5 cumulative release to `p5-cumulative-v2`.\n\nThe current source-map inventory identifies 83 relevant questions. Before admission, every complete authenticated QP image chain and MS image chain was opened directly at original detail. The resulting ledger records exact portable paths, page numbers, SHA-256 values, question-specific visible facts, part-grained terminal dispositions, and alternative MS branches.\n\n## Why\n\nThe prior active Paper 5 release contained only the P5-01 Representation Family. Permutations and combinations evidence therefore had no reviewed Family delta or cumulative successor projection. Source-map topic hints alone are insufficient because restrictions such as identical objects, adjacency, separation, labelled versus unlabeled groups, and diagram-dependent seating can only be adjudicated from the visible QP/MS evidence.\n\n## What changed\n\n- adds the future-only P5-02 producer and admits its bounded provider\n- adds the immutable visual-review ledger, predecessor receipt, and P5-02 delta\n- advances the active Paper 5 manifest and cumulative projection without changing any immutable P5-01 authority bytes\n- records 321 reviewed QuestionParts: 201 approved, 28 candidate, 79 abstain, and 13 rejected\n- retains probability/counting composites as exact-part cross-Family candidates and rejects probability-only or binomial-only source-map mismatches\n- reuses 11 shared ProcedureModels across 258 ProcedureInstances, including 57 supporting instances and 14 explicit alternative branches\n- keeps factorial arithmetic and calculator evaluation incidental rather than promoting them to ProcedureModels\n- updates the historical P5-01 test to validate its immutable delta when a successor owns the active cumulative outputs\n- adds focused P5-02 custody, semantic-boundary, deterministic-build, and readback tests\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1787_p5_permutations_combinations_semantic_kg.test.py` — 15 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1786_p5_representation_semantic_kg.test.py` — 14 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 30 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1787_p5_permutations_combinations_semantic_kg.py --check` — deterministic rebuild PASS; physical corpus authentication PASS\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — branch safety, workflow entrypoints, artifact guard, and A+ ratchet healthy; expected warnings only for the task changes and then-unset upstream\n\nVisual-review duration was not separately instrumented, so the release reports `null` with `not_instrumented` provenance rather than inventing a minute value.\n\nCloses #1787\n\n## Mandatory child metrics\n\n| Metric | Value |\n| --- | ---: |\n| `discovered_question_count` | 83 |\n| `discovered_question_part_count` | 321 |\n| `visually_reviewed_question_count` | 83 |\n| `visually_reviewed_question_part_count` | 321 |\n| `qp_image_review_count` | 138 |\n| `ms_image_review_count` | 221 |\n| `approved_count` | 201 |\n| `candidate_count` | 28 |\n| `abstain_count` | 79 |\n| `rejected_count` | 13 |\n| `unenriched_count` | 1033 |\n| `approved_question_type_count` | 9 |\n| `procedure_model_count` | 11 |\n| `procedure_instance_count` | 258 |\n| `supporting_procedure_instance_count` | 57 |\n| `alternative_branch_count` | 14 |\n| `procedure_reuse_ratio` | 23.454545 |\n| `visual_review_minutes` | `null` (`not_instrumented`) |\n| `candidate_exposed_as_approved_count` | 0 |\n| future cache build / hit / miss | 1 / 1 / 1 |\n| active artifact count | 5 |\n| active artifact total bytes | 7254520 |\n\n`unenriched_count` is the frozen 1,628-part P5 denominator minus the 595 cumulative terminally dispositioned parts. Active artifact count/bytes cover the five bounded checked-in P5-02 release outputs: active manifest, Family delta, predecessor receipt, visual-review ledger, and cumulative projection.","created_at":"2026-07-30T07:05:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T12:39:09Z","closed_at":"2026-07-30T11:56:37Z","merged_at":"2026-07-30T11:56:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"bac7033cd18e354fed052ee73c8679090efadf66","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":fals